<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Fastest Money Method: Stage Routes and ROI" description="Choose Sell Lemons money routes by stage, compare upgrades with ROI and time-to-goal, avoid risky shortcut claims, and watch embedded video references.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Money Routes</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Fastest Money Methods</h1>
          <p>Choose a fast money route by stage instead of chasing vague shortcuts. The practical choice changes when managers, activities, weather events, and reset layers become available.</p>
        </div>
